# The panels view on the default light theme, "Gesso".
Set Width 1584
Set Height 800
Source "docs/tapes/ambiente-gesso-pannelli.tape"
Output "docs/media/.scarto/principale-pannelli-gesso.gif"
Type "rada --icons nerd --images halfblocks --theme rada-light --demo vetrina ~/projects/demo"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show
Sleep 2500ms
Screenshot "docs/screenshots/principale-pannelli-gesso.png"
Sleep 1s
